SixIsland_WaterPath_Cabin_Text_NYouCame::
    .string "N: You came.\p"
    .string "The sea is so quiet here. I can\n"
    .string "hear every POKéMON on the island.\p"
    .string "And now I can hear yours.$"

SixIsland_WaterPath_Cabin_Text_NLastBattle::
    .string "N: I've been asking POKéMON what\n"
    .string "they want from people.\p"
    .string "This battle is my last question.\n"
    .string "Answer it with everything you have!$"

SixIsland_WaterPath_Cabin_Text_NDefeat::
    .string "…Yes. That's the answer I was\n"
    .string "looking for.$"

SixIsland_WaterPath_Cabin_Text_NFarewell::
    .string "N: POKéMON and people can choose\n"
    .string "each other. You and your PIKACHU\l"
    .string "showed me that.\p"
    .string "I'll travel on and tell others\n"
    .string "what I heard. Goodbye, {PLAYER}.$"

SixIsland_WaterPath_Cabin_Text_LetterOnTable::
    .string "N was gone. He left a letter\n"
    .string "on the table.$"

SixIsland_WaterPath_Cabin_Text_LetterReads::
    .string "“To {PLAYER} and PIKACHU.\n"
    .string "Thank you for letting me listen.\l"
    .string "- N”$"
